      },
      "lineNbr": 3362,
      "author": {
        "id": 1015428
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-09-27T09:40:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That\u0027s actually intentional (though confusing in review). Apps tend to call getLinkProperties() in onCapabilitiesChanged() and getNetworkCapabilities() in onLinkPropertiesChanged() so that they get the missing piece. That\u0027s why these are the ones I called out, but I also do say \"or other synchronous methods\". Let me know if you think this should be made clearer.\n\n(well really what apps tend to do is call getNetworkCapabilities() in onAvailable(). But still.)",
      "parentUuid": "62a7e9aa_50bf7a51",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 3362,
        "startChar": 34,
        "endLine": 3362,
        "endChar": 56
