      "writtenOn": "2019-08-30T15:08:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "{@link NetworkRequest}, or ...passed {@link NetworkCapabilities} (part of {@code request})\nOR\nupdate \u0027@param request\u0027 so that it talks about NetworkCapabilities...something like: \"{@link NetworkRequest} describing the {@link NetworkCapabilities} of the requested network\"\n\n\nalthough NetworkCapabilities are added to the request, it may not be evident to someone reading this without knowing about how to create a NetworkRequest",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 3649,
        "startChar": 14,
        "endLine": 3649,
        "endChar": 33
      },
      "revId": "afac33257a1f1794a2a9268f80ed55535029b03e",
