        "id": 1015428
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-09-27T09:40:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think it\u0027s a good idea to call the NC out because the NC in NetworkRequest is hidden. You\u0027ll build one with NR.Builder() which has methods that cover a subset of NC.\n\nI changed that to NetworkRequest.",
      "parentUuid": "af4c5128_8b311da4",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 3649,
        "startChar": 14,
        "endLine": 3649,
        "endChar": 33
      },
      "revId": "afac33257a1f1794a2a9268f80ed55535029b03e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
