        "id": 1015428
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-09-27T09:40:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I chose \"...if none satisfies the criteria\" to avoid implying that any connected network will be returned (in case at some point we have some networks that for some reason need to be invisible to some apps). Let me know if that works for you.",
      "parentUuid": "c1dc4091_11c21866",
